  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "通訊與網路概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO NETWORK COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "此課程著重在提供一個在資料和網路通訊的概觀。重點在於網路方面技術與架構的論題和原理。下列兩項目標為主要教學目標：1：幫助學生了解協定的用途與介紹目前網路架構的理論基礎 2：讓學生了解TCP/IP協定架構和網際網路的原理。",
    "describe_eh": "The aim of this course is to provide a unified overview in the basic principles of data and computer communications. The lecture series emphasize basic principles and topics of fundamental importance concerning the technology and architecture of this field, as well as providing the state of the art topics. Students should achieve the following basic objectives: 1：To understand the need of protocols and to describe current networking paradigms at a theoretical level 2：To understand the TCP/IP protocol architecture and the principle of internetworking",
    "pre_subname": "IEE1000計算機概論(一)、IEE1001計算機概論(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IEE1000",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IEE1000 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER(1)、IEE1001 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER(2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能理解網路的架構與原理",
      "describe_en": "Comprehend structures and theories of computer networks."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能應用對網路進行規劃",
      "describe_en": " Apply theories to computer network designs."
    }
